WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,500
The strong are very powerful

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,900
It's possible to complete reinforcements on this scale, right?

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,740
Can such a steel fortress be built in the apocalypse?

4
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,940
They are also a group of capable people.

5
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,500
Maybe they are comrades in arms.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,180
I'll go up and see what's going on inside.

7
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:21,670
Not so strong

8
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:26,130
respectively lost

9
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,530
How could this happen?

10
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,140
We ourselves were here some time ago

11
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,300
There are only humans inside
